{"id":"zumindest","lemma":"zumindest","pos":"adv","rank":723,"glosses":["at least"],"ipa":"/t͡suˈmɪndəst/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/64/De-zumindest.ogg/De-zumindest.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich muss es zumindest versuchen.","en":"I have to at least try.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756474","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to try, to attempt"}]},{"text":"Zumindest lebe ich noch.","en":"At least I'm still alive.","words":[null,{"g":"a state in which…","l":"Leben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"still / yet"}]},{"text":"Zumindest bin ich älter als du.","en":"At least I'm older than you.","words":[null,{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"old","l":"alt"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Zumindest daran besteht kein Zweifel.","en":"At least there's no doubt about that.","words":[null,{"g":"on it, on that"},{"g":"to succeed, to pass","l":"bestehen"},{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"doubt"}]},{"text":"Mein Bruder ist sehr wichtig. Zumindest denkt er das.","en":"My brother is very important. At least he thinks he is.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/602","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"important"},null,{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"the / that"}]}]}